<title>USA: TENNIS-CHAMPIONS CUP MEN'S RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHAMPIONS CUP MEN'S RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at</p>
<p>the $2.3 million Champions Cup men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>3-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 2-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-1 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1)</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
